{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一實叉難陀，此云覺喜，唐天后久視元年譯，八紙。二阿彌真那，此云寶思惟，中宗神龍二年譯，七紙。三\n唐天后代，三藏法師義淨譯，三紙。四唐天竺三藏法師菩提流志，此云覺愛譯，十九紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語一洛叉，此云十萬數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國王、后妃、公主、宰官、四姓，所謂各有其數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如《十六觀經》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮已，長跪執爐燒香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執爐捧華\n運想已散之，復云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起禮一拜，曲躬讚云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丑家切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "市傳切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名根本呪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名大心呪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "多旱切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名隨心呪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或三稱或七稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "L135n1571_p0720b02"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "L135n1571_p0721a07"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "L135n1571_p0722a08"}
