{"id": null, "n": "0983001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0983001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】康熙六年刊增上寺報恩藏本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0983b0901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0983b0901", "type": "add", "text": "各【CB】【龍-CB】，名【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0983b2901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0983b2901", "type": "add", "text": "設【CB】【龍-CB】，說【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0983c1501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0983c1501", "type": "add", "text": "蠃【CB】，羸【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0984a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0984a0101", "type": "add", "text": "如【CB】【龍-CB】，妬【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0984b0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0984b0601", "type": "add", "text": "叉【CB】【龍-CB】，又【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0984b0602", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0984b0602", "type": "add", "text": "苟【CB】，荀【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0984b1301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0984b1301", "type": "add", "text": "寶【CB】【龍-CB】，觀【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0984c1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0984c1401", "type": "add", "text": "傳【CB】【龍-CB】，悅【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0984c1501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0984c1501", "type": "add", "text": "癹【CB】【龍-CB】，發【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0985a1501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0985a1501", "type": "add", "text": "CBETA 按：原作者科分有七（T46n1952_p0983a19），然本部所錄僅至前五分後半段。本部未載內容可見於《乾隆藏》〈觀自在菩薩如意輪咒課法〉（L135n1571_p0726a06-p0730a05）。"}
